# .numinance (organization policy repository)

Written by `numi init --org-dir`. Org-scoped documents: the stage registry `pr-only`, the playbook and toolchain
definitions, the grants of an SDLCProfile and the autonomy floors (a ceiling of PR for every change, SUGGEST for HIGH
risk). Only the org scope sets these. Protect `.numinance/policy/**` on the default branch. Read it with
`numi validate --org THIS_DIR REPOSITORY` (engine build).

The kernel floors of the Numinance engine are always on and no document here can weaken them.
